Section 1: A Quick KQL 101
How many employees are in the company?
Employees
| count
Answer: 1867

Which employee has the IP address: 10.10.0.1?
Employees
| where ip_addr == "10.10.0.1"
Answer: Shirley Jackson

How many emails did Wayne Sutton, the Marketing Coordinator, receive?
let wayne_email=
Employees
| where name == "Wayne Sutton" and role == "Marketing Coordinator"
| project email_addr;
Email
| where recipient in (wayne_email)
Answer: 46

How many distinct senders were seen in the email logs from scavengers-r-us.org?
Email
| where sender contains "scavengers-r-us.org"
| distinct sender
Answer: 6107

How many unique URLs (websites) did Patricia Robinson visit?
let patricia_ip=
Employees
| where name == "Patricia Robinson"
| project ip_addr;
OutboundNetworkEvents
| where src_ip in (patricia_ip)
| distinct url
Answer: 61

How many domains in the PassiveDns records contain the word “power”?
PassiveDns
| where domain contains "power"
| distinct domain
Answer: 60

What IP starting with a 196. did the domain critical-power.net resolve to?
PassiveDns
| where domain contains "critical-power.net"
| distinct ip
Answer: 196.98.239.46

How many unique URLs were browsed by employees named “Karen”?
let karen_ips=
Employees
| where name contains "Karen"
| project ip_addr;
OutboundNetworkEvents
| where src_ip in (karen_ips)
| distinct url
Answer: 369


Section 2: Ghost In The Wire (Flee You Mortal Peasant)
The threat actors exfiltrated data about your secret energy program. Under what filename did they stage the exfiltration data?
ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline contains "copy"
Then:
ProcessEvents
| where hostname == "IYIP-DESKTOP"
| where timestamp >= datetime(2323-07-28T14:09:20.000Z)
Answer: ScooterEnergyResearch.zip

How many machines (hosts) did the actors exfiltrate data from?
ProcessEvents
| where process_commandline contains "C:\\ScooterEnergyResearch" and process_commandline contains "Copy-Item"
Answer: 4

What command did the threat actor use to gather the data to be exfiltrated?
Answer: Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue -Filter *.docx,*.ppt,*.pdf,*.xlsx | ForEach-Object {Copy-Item $_.FullName "C:\ScooterEnergyResearch"}

During the staging process, what command did the threat actor use to compress the exfiltrated data?
Answer: Compress-Archive -Path "C:\ScooterEnergyResearch" -DestinationPath "C:\ScooterEnergyResearch.zip" -Force

The threat actors used a command to exfiltrate the data using a common service. What was the subject?
Answer: Game Set Match

What command did the operators use to establish persistence on their victims?
Answer: schtasks /create /sc hourly /tn "IsThisYourKing" /tr "C:\\Windows\\Temp\\ggwp.exe" /ru SYSTEM

